@startuml
[*] --> NORMAL : Spawn

NORMAL --> FAILSAFE : Network Timeout (Missed Heartbeats)
NORMAL --> FAILSAFE : SysCommand(ENTER_FAILSAFE)
NORMAL --> DISCONNECTED : SysCommand(ENTER_DISCONNECTED)

FAILSAFE --> NORMAL : Connection Restored (Receive Command)
FAILSAFE --> NORMAL : SysCommand(EXIT_FAILSAFE)
FAILSAFE --> DISCONNECTED : SysCommand(ENTER_DISCONNECTED)

DISCONNECTED --> NORMAL : SysCommand(EXIT_DISCONNECTED)

note right of NORMAL
  - Receives controller commands
  - Publishes telemetry
end note

note right of FAILSAFE
  - Local failsafe logic
  - Ignores controller commands
  - Publishes telemetry
end note

note right of DISCONNECTED
  - Local failsafe logic
  - No network interaction
  - Others may see it as a ghost
end note
@enduml